      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 61px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/c8/Likeability.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721183219\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Likeability icon.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/c8/Likeability.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721183219\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"61\" height=\"65\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Likeability.png\" data-image-key=\"Likeability.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Likeability icon.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><b>Likeability</b> is a stat that applies to the selectable characters <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a>. At certain likeability levels new expressions are unlocked for the character.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Sources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Version_history\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Version history</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#2.2.3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2.2.3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#2.1.2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2.1.2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources\">Sources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLikeability%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Likeability can come from many sources, such as requests or challenge quest reward. Most requests grant a certain percentage chance for likability to be obtained alongside the normal reward. Challenge quests are notable for <i>only</i> offering likeability as a reward.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_history\">Version history</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLikeability%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2.2.3\">2.2.3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLikeability%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The maximum likeability level was raised from 10000 to 15000.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2.1.2\">2.1.2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLikeability%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The maximum likeability level was raised from 5000 to 10000.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013020905\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpens